spfmilter (Sender Policy Framework mail filter module)

Spfmilter implements the Sender Policy Framework (SPF) as a milter. 

To enable it, do the following:
chmod 755 /etc/rc.d/rc.spfmilter
/etc/rc.d/rc.spfmilter start
echo '/etc/rc.d/rc.spfmilter start' >> /etc/rc.d/rc.local
echo '/etc/rc.d/rc.spfmilter stop' >> /etc/rc.d/rc.local_shutdown
echo 'smtpd_milters = inet:localhost:2526' >> /etc/postfix/main.cf
echo 'non_smtpd_milters = inet:localhost:2526' >> /etc/postfix/main.cf
postfix reload
